{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay in the Rhythm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the neon haze of <i>Stay in the Rhythm</i> \u2014 a 2D top-down rogue-like rhythm game where every punch, dash, and ability drop <strong>hits to the beat</strong>. <br>You\u2019re just a regular guy thrown into a chaotic cyberpunk nightmare, where the streets pulse with <i>phonk</i> and the only rule is simple: <strong>move with the music or die off-beat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through waves of twisted enemies \u2014 part machine, part myth \u2014 as dark purple lights cut through the black void of the city. Time your attacks to the rhythm, chain perfect combos, and watch the world move in sync with your flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run hits different. Every track changes the pace. <br>Lose yourself to the sound \u2014 and <strong>stay in the rhythm.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102240?t=1761733174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102240?t=1761733174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102240/d2d0f0cb2c57e4fb1925f3b60f51435e5087ba77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761733174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102240/d2d0f0cb2c57e4fb1925f3b60f51435e5087ba77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761733174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game features a dark atmosphere and combat against enemies, but the violence is stylized and non-realistic, presented in a cartoon-like way rather than graphic or gory. There is no explicit adult content such as sexual themes, sexual violence, BDSM, drug or alcohol abuse, or self-harm. The tone is action-focused rather than disturbing or shock-oriented."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay in the Rhythm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the neon haze of <i>Stay in the Rhythm</i> \u2014 a 2D top-down rogue-like rhythm game where every punch, dash, and ability drop <strong>hits to the beat</strong>. <br>You\u2019re just a regular guy thrown into a chaotic cyberpunk nightmare, where the streets pulse with <i>phonk</i> and the only rule is simple: <strong>move with the music or die off-beat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through waves of twisted enemies \u2014 part machine, part myth \u2014 as dark purple lights cut through the black void of the city. Time your attacks to the rhythm, chain perfect combos, and watch the world move in sync with your flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run hits different. Every track changes the pace. <br>Lose yourself to the sound \u2014 and <strong>stay in the rhythm.</strong></p>","developers":["Game Virgo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102240/eaacdcb447cbde0b12b96db5d6963978a4538cef/header.jpg?t=1761733174","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4102240/24385627/f0f8461f3ed4d6d3a5fe3702ca9bbd5579b78ea8/1760434422/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761733172","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4102240/24385627/f0f8461f3ed4d6d3a5fe3702ca9bbd5579b78ea8/1760434422/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761733172","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4102240/24385627/f0f8461f3ed4d6d3a5fe3702ca9bbd5579b78ea